{
    "title": "ConnectNetwork by GTL",
    "description": "The ConnectNetwork mobile app provides quick access to our most popular services. Using the app, you can create a ConnectNetwork account, manage your account information, make deposits into various accounts, send Messages, photos and videos to your loved ones, and (NEW) take advantage of Walk-In-Retail (Pay by cash) as an alternative to using a credit card.\u2028\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nOur features are based on the facility. To find out which features are available to your inmate, please add them to your account.\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\n\u2022 Create and Manage your ConnectNetwork Account\u2028\u2028\r\n\u2022 Make Payments and Deposits for ConnectNetwork services, such as:\r\n\r\n\u2028\u2028o AdvancePay Phone (Prepaid Collect)\u2028o Trust Fund (Inmate Trust Account)\u2028\r\no PIN Debit (Inmate Phone Account)\u2028\u2028\r\no Debit Link (Inmate Account for Tablet Services)\r\no Walk-In-Retail, a new convenient cash payment method\u2028\r\n\r\n\u2022 Messaging (Email)\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\no View your Messaging inbox, send and compose messages, and save drafts\u2028\r\no Use your credit or debit card to purchase Message credits\u2028\r\no Add a photo or video attachment to your Message\u2028\r\no Depending on the facility, send credits to receive a reply",
    "descriptionHTML": "The ConnectNetwork mobile app provides quick access to our most popular services. Using the app, you can create a ConnectNetwork account, manage your account information, make deposits into various accounts, send Messages, photos and videos to your loved ones, and (NEW) take advantage of Walk-In-Retail (Pay by cash) as an alternative to using a credit card.\u2028\u2028\u2028<br><br>Our features are based on the facility. To find out which features are available to your inmate, please add them to your account.\u2028\u2028<br><br>\u2022 Create and Manage your ConnectNetwork Account\u2028\u2028<br>\u2022 Make Payments and Deposits for ConnectNetwork services, such as:<br><br>\u2028\u2028o AdvancePay Phone (Prepaid Collect)\u2028o Trust Fund (Inmate Trust Account)\u2028<br>o PIN Debit (Inmate Phone Account)\u2028\u2028<br>o Debit Link (Inmate Account for Tablet Services)<br>o Walk-In-Retail, a new convenient cash payment method\u2028<br><br>\u2022 Messaging (Email)\u2028\u2028<br><br>o View your Messaging inbox, send and compose messages, and save drafts\u2028<br>o Use your credit or debit card to purchase Message credits\u2028<br>o Add a photo or video attachment to your Message\u2028<br>o Depending on the facility, send credits to receive a reply",
